53%2Fcoding_weihnachten_2021.png%3Fex%3D695e3cc9%26is%3D695ceb49%26hm%3D37254ad15ac530ce125e47ce2e2d82daae1766ea71d7989b915cb6fbcfd33299%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\nE\\n\\neN\\\\_Pilz\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\n@everyone\\n\\n4 years ago\\n\\n😐👍🎄179\\n\\nE\\n\\neN\\\\_Pilz\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\nEin gutes neues Jahr @everyone\\n\\n5 years ago\\n\\n👀🍉aws23\\n\\nE\\n\\neN\\\\_Pilz\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\n🎄🎄🎁🎄Frohe Weihnachten 🎄🎁🎄🎄\\n\\n5 years ago\\n\\n❤️💀45\\n\\nE\\n\\neN\\\\_Pilz\\n\\nAdmin\\n\\nDer c0d1n6.io TeamSpeak wurde auf Discord migriert.\\n\\n5 years ago\",\"description\":\"Playing Custom Status\",\"url\":\"/community/news\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"locale\":\"en\"},\"2\":{\"title\":\"Community Guidelines\",\"content\":\"# Community Guidelines\\n\\n\\\\>catcommunity\\\\_rules.txt\\n\\n12 rules loaded successfully...\\n\\n#1General\\n\\n### 1\\\\. Discord guidelines\\n\\nThe Discord Community Guidelines apply to Programming \\\\[DE / EN\\\\]; users can view these at https://discord.com/guidelines.\\n\\n#2General\\n\\n### 2\\\\. Language\\n\\nThe language of our community is German and English. In the voice channel, \\\"Public \\\\[DE\\\\]\\\" German is the primary language. Users can speak English voluntarily. However, users must speak English in the Voice Channel \\\"Public \\\\[EN\\\\]\\\".\\n\\n#3General\\n\\n### 3\\\\. Asking questions\\n\\n3.1 Nobody is obliged to help or answer a question. Help is generally free of charge. 3.2 Members with the role of \\\"HELPER\\\" have volunteered to help with questions. 3.3 Pinging members to expect a faster response is not allowed. 3.4 Don't ask questions like \\\"Does anyone know about XY?\\\" ask the question directly, see also ➔ https://dontasktoask.com/. 3.5 Note the thread \\\"How do I ask a good question?\\\" on Stackoverflow ➔ https://stackoverflow.com/help/how-to-ask.\\n\\n#4Behavior\\n\\n### 4\\\\. Recording\\n\\nThe recording of videos (screen sharing, webcam) and sound (voice chat) is not permitted on this Discord.\\n\\n#5Behavior\\n\\n### 5\\\\. Advertising\\n\\nAny kind of third-party advertising is prohibited.\\n\\n#6Authority\\n\\n### 6\\\\. Moderators\\n\\nThe moderation team has the right to take appropriate actions against a user, even if a certain rule has not been explicitly violated.\\n\\n#7Behavior\\n\\n### 7\\\\. Direct messages\\n\\nPlease refrain from sending direct messages to the administrators.\\n\\n#8Behavior\\n\\n### 8\\\\. Dissemination of personal information\\n\\nDissemination of other people's personal information of any kind without their consent is prohibited and will result in a permanent ban.\\n\\n#9Authority\\n\\n### 9\\\\. Enforcement of a measure\\n\\nThe interpretation of the rules is at the discretion of the respective administrator.\\n\\n#10Content\\n\\n### 10\\\\. AI Use / Spam / Job listings\\n\\nThe use of AI to make job listings or other spam content is not permitted. Users found doing so will be jailed, muted, or banned.\\n\\n#11Content\\n\\n### 11\\\\. Fake Skills / Code Stacks\\n\\nFalsely claiming to have skills or experience for the purpose of scamming or obtaining jobs is prohibited. Users must be able to prove their skills.\\n\\n#12Content\\n\\n### 12\\\\. No DM\\n\\nNo direct messages without previous authorization. If someone reports you, you may be muted or restricted.\",\"description\":\"The Discord Community Guidelines apply to Programming [DE / EN]; users can view these at https://discord.com/guidelines.\",\"url\":\"/community/rules\",\"category\":\"Community\",\"locale\":\"en\"},\"3\":{\"title\":\"Community Showcase\",\"content\":\"# Community Showcase(146)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Treasure Walk ||(my first simple RL)||\\n\\nGoal: A bot learning to reach treasure args: • --play (to see the \\\"trained\\\" bot play) • --train (to train it) • --epoch <int> (given with train arg to train it \\\"n\\\" times) It can be done by simple algo but who does that, pros make their own learning bots 😎\\n\\nF\\n\\nfaizu\\n\\nJunior Dev!\\n\\n8 messages\\n\\n2 members