s\\n\\n15 hours ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457934831890468946)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Discord Bot (Raid Checker for X/Twitter)\\n\\nJob\\n\\nAPI 🔌\\n\\nBasically we have a running but which stopped working. It was scraping 100 replies per request via API, and after we highered the requests to 10x 100 replies it started with errors. We need someone who can fix that. Contact me on Discord, payment can be discussed. 🙂\\n\\nB\\n\\nburninsolana\\n\\nPlaying Custom Status\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n2 messages\\n\\n1 members\\n\\n17 hours ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457903584158159070)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Discord Bot Replica Needed\\n\\nJob\\n\\nBot Dev 🤝\\n\\nG\\n\\n100\\n\\nPlaying Custom Status\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n1 messages\\n\\n1 members\\n\\na day ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457807862402125936)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Custom Bot Development\\n\\nJob\\n\\nBackend ⚙️Bot Dev 🤝\\n\\nI need someone who can make a custom bot that can auto / buy sell on Kalshi and other prediction market sites like Polymarket. Primarily built for Kalshi is fine. I will give parameters on when it should buy and when it should sell and in what categories and it will automatically do that on its own without any manual involvement. If you can develop or build something like this quickly & effectively for Kalshi, let me know. The budget is $200 Let me know if you're interested\\n\\nC\\n\\nComet💫\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n2 messages\\n\\n1 members\\n\\na day ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457794852929667216)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Looking for Sr. Software Engineer\\n\\nDev\\n\\nPart-Time ⏰Contract 📄Mid-Level 👨‍💻Remote 🌎Senior 👑\\n\\nRequirement: Must be EU or US citizen with linkedin profile. Offer : 60$ ~ 120$/hr If interested in please DM me!\\n\\nE\\n\\nEric Jonasson\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 messages\\n\\n1 members\\n\\na day ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457741699664052369)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Looking for Sr. Software Engineer\\n\\nJob\\n\\nBackend ⚙️Full-Stack 🔄AI/ML 🤖Frontend 🌐WordPress 🌎\\n\\nNow I am looking for Sr. Software Engineer. Requirement : Must be EU or US citizen. Offer: 60 ~ 120$/hr If interested in, please DM me!\\n\\nE\\n\\nEric Jonasson\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 messages\\n\\n1 members\\n\\na day ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/marketplace/1457741385817002084)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![Custom DonutSMP Gambling Discord Bot (Discord.js / Python)](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1457717311200034879%2F1457717311547904139%2FScreenshot_2026-01-05_174124.png%3Fex%3D695e560a%26is%3D695d048a%26hm%3D0107e0553686753a2bb751c7aad0c9e02ea05979f3e7502c72d968e8dbcd9066%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### Custom DonutSMP Gambling Discord Bot (Discord.js / Python)\\n\\nJob\\n\\nBackend ⚙️Bot Dev 🤝\\n\\nI’m looking for an experienced \\\\*\\\\*Discord bot developer\\\\*\\\\* to build a \\\\*\\\\*custom gambling bot\\\\*\\\\* for a \\\\*\\\\*DonutSMP-based Discord server\\\\*\\\\*. The bot will allow users to gamble using their \\\\*\\\\*in-game DonutSMP cash\\\\*\\\\*, which is transferred between Minecraft and Discord via a designated in-game player account acting as the \\\\*\\\\*bank/bot\\\\*\\\\*. --- ## \\\\*\\\\*🧠 Core Concept\\\\*\\\\* - Users \\\\*\\\\*deposit DonutSMP cash\\\\*\\\\* by sending money in-game to a specific Minecraft account (bank/bot) - The Discord bot \\\\*\\\\*tracks deposits\\\\*\\\\*, maintains user balances, and enables gambling inside Discord - Users can \\\\*\\\\*withdraw winnings\\\\*\\\\*, triggering a payout from the bank account back to the player in-game --- ## \\\\*\\\\*🛠 Planned Features\\\\*\\\\* - Secure \\\\*\\\\*deposit & withdrawal system\\\\*\\\\* linked to in-game currency - User balance tracking & \\\\*\\\\*transaction logs\\\\*\\\\* - Gambling games (e.g. \\\\*\\\\*poker, mines, coinflip\\\\*\\\\*, etc.) - \\\\*\\\\*Slash commands\\\\*\\\\* - Admin controls & \\\\*\\\\*anti-abuse protections\\\\*\\\\* - Clean, \\\\*\\\\*scalable codebase\\\\*\\\\* with proper permis