ng out Creator Mode: Find viewers who will engage with your content, understand their desires, and get growth ideas No login required — start researching instantly Clean, mobile-friendly UI I’m exploring selling or licensing it rather than scaling myself. If this sounds like something you or someone you know could use, I can show a quick demo.\\n\\nM\\n\\n𝙰𝚜𝚑⚡\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n12 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1453677779773034668)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### DoctorAppointmentApp\\n\\nThis is just a fun project I am working on to experiment more with C++, SQL, and AWS. The app pulls up a login where you login as one of the doctors from the database and then once you go in, you can set up, view or delete appointments.\\n\\nN\\n\\nDokkitheAstronaut\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n2 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n14 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1453228368282779648)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![PokeAggregator](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1453192108088230009%2F1453192108914769980%2Fog-image.png%3Fex%3D695e5a5d%26is%3D695d08dd%26hm%3Ddb2e51cdd65c1a674438f2fc32513066085c12a81fb45c9e9d9d26516a91fed4%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### PokeAggregator\\n\\nI built \\\\*\\\\*PokeAggregator\\\\*\\\\* a centralized archive that empowers Pokémon fans to effortlessly discover and explore over \\\\*\\\\*1,293\\\\*\\\\* fan-made games and ROM hacks. Tired of scouring scattered forums and sites for quality community projects? This tool solves that by aggregating detailed metadata from trusted sources like \\\\*\\\\*PokeHarbor\\\\*\\\\*, including release dates, versions, statuses (like Completed or In Progress), engines (RPGXP or GBA), and direct links to game pages all in one intuitive interface. ## Key features - \\\\*\\\\*Robust filters\\\\*\\\\* let users narrow down by status, engine, or source for targeted searches; - Sections for \\\\*\\\\*\\\"New Games\\\"\\\\*\\\\* and \\\\*\\\\*\\\"Recent Updates\\\"\\\\*\\\\* keep you ahead of the curve on fresh content; - Each entry provides gameplay insights, like estimated playtime for demos (e.g., 1.5–2 hours), making it simple to find your next adventure without the hassle. Deployed on \\\\*\\\\*Vercel\\\\*\\\\* for seamless performance, \\\\*\\\\*PokeAggregator\\\\*\\\\* transforms fragmented fan content into an organized, accessible hub that saves time and enhances the Pokémon community experience. Whether you're a player hunting demos or a creator tracking trends, it makes exploration efficient and engaging, proving that smart aggregation drives discovery. Check it out at - LIVE: \\\\[PokeAggregator\\\\](https://poke-aggregator.vercel.app/) - REPO: \\\\[Github\\\\](https://github.com/xodo2fast4u/poke-aggregator) and level up your fan game journey.\\n\\nX\\n\\nxodobyte\\n\\nVibe Coder!\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n14 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1453192108088230009)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### my journey into algorithmic trading and machine learning\\n\\nc++\\n\\nGemini Writeup: \\\\_\\\\_ Here is the problem I faced and the solution I built: ### 📉 The Problem: Visualizing the \\\"Black Box\\\" In algo trading and ML, the data isn't just text—it is millions of floating-point numbers (market ticks, tensor weights, probability distributions) generated at high frequency. I needed to see this data in real-time to debug my models, but the backend requirements were heavy: \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Server-Side Dependency:\\\\*\\\\* My trading engines and ML models relied on direct file system access and C++ DLLs that simply cannot run in a browser. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Data Volume:\\\\*\\\\* A single training epoch or backtest could generate gigabytes of \\\\`Float64\\\\` arrays. ### 🛑 Why Standard Web Tech Failed (JSON) I quickly realized I couldn't use standard REST or JSON over WebSockets. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*The Serialization Bottleneck:\\\\*\\\\* Converting a 1GB array of market ticks into JSON (text) explodes the size to \\\\*\\\\*~3GB\\\\*\\\\* and forces the CPU to burn cycles parsing strings back into numbers. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Latency:\\\\*\\\\* For real-time trading visualization, the \\\"garbage collection pause\\\" caused by parsing massive JSON objects was unacceptable. ### ⚡ The Solution: A Custom Binary Bridge To bridge this gap, I built a custom binary RPC protocol that treats the browser like a direct extension of my server's memory. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Zero-Copy Math:\\\\*\\\\* I implemented a system in \\\\`rpc-args.ts\\\\` and \\\\`encoding.ts\\\\` that serializes TypedArrays (like \\\\`Float64Array\\\\`) directly into binary. This allows my trading algorithms to dump raw numerical buffers into a WebSocket, which the browser reads immediately without parsing overhead. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Remote Execution:\\\\*\\\\* I built a transport layer (\\\\`sender.ts\\\\`) that lets the client invoke server-only functions (like executing a trade via a DLL) by sending compact binary commands.\\n\\nS\\n\\nNo1\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n6 Nachrichten\\n\\n2 Mitglieder\\n\\n14 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1453042627669786684)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Jsv-system\\n\\nJSV: A Simpler Way to Organize Data Tired of spreadsheet chaos but intimidated by databases? JSV offers a middle ground - structured data without complexity. What it is: · File-based system (no servers, no SQL) · Clean .jst files for your data · Simple queries with JQL language · Excel-ready .jsv exports Example .jst file: \\\\`\\\\`\\\\`jst database{ name: \\\"library\\\" } required{ \\\\* } schema{ title: {type: \\\"string\\\"} author: {type: \\\"string\\\"} read: {type: \\\"bool\\\"} } data{ {title: \\\"The Great Gatsby\\\", author: \\\"Fitzgerald\\\", read: true} } \\\\`\\\\`\\\\` Simple queries: \\\\`\\\\`\\\\`bash jsv query \\\"QUERY library.data WHERE read = false\\\" jsv query \\\"COUNT library.data\\\" \\\\`\\\\`\\\\` Perfect for: · Small business inventory · Personal collections · Research data · Any list that's outgrown spreadsheets Get started: \\\\`\\\\`\\\\`bash npm install -g jsv-system jsv init my-project \\\\`\\\\`\\\\` GitHub: https://github.com/JSV-net/jsv-system Simple, file-based, no subscriptions. Try it with one small project first.\\n\\nC\\n\\nCoderX-176-max\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n18 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1451706014523982015)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Digital Country With All Things Real Countries Has\\n\\nSo i made a country digitally, so it has its own currency, flag, territory and fun activities to do like jobs or a shop or a chatting site or a bank, all this made in HTML+CSS+JS and Firebase, also you can even get a custom passport ALL FOR FREE heres the link pls review and give me a feedback https://revinoria-gov.netlify.app\\n\\nH\\n\\nℍ𝕪𝕡𝕖𝕣/ℍ𝕒𝕣𝕕𝕖𝕣\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n5 Nachrichten\\n\\n3 Mitglieder\\n\\n18 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1451648625544270045)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Evaluating website\\n\\nArchiviert 17 days ago\\n\\nL\\n\\nLuna🌙\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n2 Nachrichten\\n\\n0 Mitglieder\\n\\n19 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1451336494060146769)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Elo Based Poker Site\\n\\nHey everyone I built a chess inspired app to play with friends It’s build in next js. https://pokerino.io would love to get some feedback!\\n\\nS\\n\\nswupel\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n19 days ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1451242677533413387)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### SELF-ATTENDANCE-TRACKER\\n\\n“I’ve built a site called AttendanceTracker.” “It’s a web app that helps students monitor their attendance and see how many classes they need to attend to stay above 75%. ”This is a beginner MERN STACK project try this with ur dummy emails and dm me if u face any issue. https://self-attendance-tracker-frontend.onrender.com/\\n\\nB\\n\\nAravind\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\