e SETI@Home, and how might that threat materialize? DDoS attacks. The attacker can create botnets and afterwards commands the botnets by giving the botnets the instructions to carry out in order to crash the server with massive amounts of malicious traffic. After having that incident, the server may give an error message service unavailable or too many requests due to the fact that the server is in denial of service.\\n\\nN\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n3 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n6 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/coding/other/1389628660725846016)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Macro on Autoit Help\\n\\nArchiviert 5 months ago\\n\\nCan you help me with some code. Im making a macro for a game buts it very anti-macro with all the different spawn points and i have some good progress with it but im running into many roadblocks. Help would be much appreciated.\\n\\nB\\n\\nActive!\\n\\n1 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n6 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/coding/other/1387932073674932284)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Bash with windows\\n\\nArchiviert 5 months ago\\n\\nHi Since i don't wanna install Linux on my computer and I need bash for something on Windows, is there any way I can achieve that. like bash on windows with all of the cmds in linux <@755228225516339360>\\n\\nR\\n\\nDevx\\n\\nCopy Paster!\\n\\n77 Nachrichten\\n\\n2 Mitglieder\\n\\n6 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/coding/other/1387916379742802047)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Shitty Linux Instalation\\n\\nArchiviert 3 months agoGesperrt\\n\\n.\\n\\n.\\n\\nSilent\\n\\nSpielt Albion Online\\n\\nHelper\\n\\n551 Nachrichten\\n\\n2 Mitglieder\\n\\n6 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/coding/other/1387215724904452096)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Look forward to a collaboration.\\n\\nArchiviert 6 months ago\\n\\nHi everyone. Im looking for someone who speaks fluent English for a collaboration. I can help devlopers get J2 and give some tips for OE. Let's connect.\\n\\nH\\n\\nharvest08\\n\\nVerified\\n\