h layers like AMSI and ETW patching, NTDLL unhooking, and UAC elevation. Small footprint, no CRT overhead, fully obfuscated, and tuned for quiet execution. Each payload build is polymorphic due to encryption and section renaming.\\n\\nN\\n\\nVibe Coder!\\n\\n4 messages\\n\\n1 members\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/community/showcase/1406123852937039995)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![🎨 SubSlay.app – Turn your text into color!](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1405938354985373747%2F1405938355287359562%2Fi_love_tree.png%3Fex%3D695e7da0%26is%3D695d2c20%26hm%3D1b83ff0c894f778f0976deb7172062b7224dcfd1b682d72c84f554be1405ac75%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### 🎨 SubSlay.app – Turn your text into color!\\n\\nArchived 4 months ago\\n\\nrust\\n\\nType anything, and every word gets its own unique hue. Make your messages pop, express vibes, or just have fun with colors — all instantly! 🌈\\n\\nA\\n\\nandria\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n7 messages\\n\\n2 members\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/community/showcase/1405938354985373747)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Cybersecurity tool\\n\\nArchived 4 months ago\\n\\npython\\n\\nQuick cybersecurity tool for pentesting called Netra. terminal based tool pure py works on linux environments. It is a red team tool for network scanning spectically via mDNS. Feel free to dm for script\\n\\nJ\\n\\nJonas Savimbe\\n\\nScript Kiddie!\\n\\n1 messages\\n\\n2 members\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/en/community/showcase/1405764488170311852)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Conquer server emulation\\n\\nArchived 4 months ago\\n\\nc#\\n\\nhttps://github.com/berniemackie97/OpenConquerPub Making an open source server emulation for an old game I used to play as a kid. It's been a fun experience reverse engineering the client to figure out the packet structures and communication encryptions. If anyone is interested in joining up or expanding on it it's fully open source. This has been pretty fun so far so if you have any other ideas or games you