### \\\\*\\\\*Tech Stack\\\\*\\\\* \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Frontend:\\\\*\\\\* React, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*AI Engine:\\\\*\\\\* Google Gemini 2.5-Flash with Structured Output \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Compression:\\\\*\\\\* The \\\\`browser-image-compression\\\\` library \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Core Architecture:\\\\*\\\\* Iterative Reduction Cascade (IRC) ### \\\\*\\\\*Key Features & Challenges Overcome\\\\*\\\\* The main goal was to solve the common frustration of \\\"file too large\\\" errors and the tedious trial-and-error of manual compression. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Iterative Reduction Cascade (IRC):\\\\*\\\\* This is the core feature. The AI designs a \\\"ladder\\\" of compression strategies, from gentle to aggressive. If one attempt fails to reduce the file size, it automatically tries the next one. It doesn't give up. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*100% Browser-Side Privacy:\\\\*\\\\* No files are ever uploaded to a server. All the processing is done directly in your browser, which means your data is completely private and the process is very fast. \\\\* \\\\*\\\\*Radical Transparency:\\\\*\\\\* You can watch the AI \\\"struggle\\\" in a live log. It shows you every attempt, failure, and which strategy finally succeeded. I'd love to hear your thoughts and any feedback you might have. Let me know what you think\\n\\nA\\n\\nArdelyo\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n2 Nachrichten\\n\\n3 Mitglieder\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1404787086552207452)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![QuickBrowse](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1404775268358422600%2F1404775269851467847%2Fimage.png%3Fex%3D695e36eb%26is%3D695ce56b%26hm%3Df240a051e5f8c67d2183569f98345a0a8f69d6af4a7e12b5df30ecf52f312dd7%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### QuickBrowse\\n\\nArchiviert 3 months ago\\n\\nQuickBrowse is a Browse especially designed for browsing together, with QuickBrowse you can create browsing sessions with friends, where you have a Chat for communicating, you can watch together Youtube videos with real time sync aswell as tab and url sync, you see where your friend is and you can even share your cursor to show him something.Another feature is SplitView you can view multiple Tabs at once to improve productivity. But its not fully done, im currently working on the UI and improving performance. For more information look on my Github or DM me github: https://github.com/KreakxX/QuickBrowse feel free to star my Repo 👍\\n\\nK\\n\\nKreakxX\\n\\nHelper\\n\\n46 Nachrichten\\n\\n5 Mitglieder\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1404775268358422600)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### shadcn-cookies\\n\\nArchiviert 4 months ago\\n\\nhtml & css\\n\\nSleek and flexible cookie consent component, designed with shadcn/ui site: https://shadcn-cookies.vercel.app gh: https://github.com/kaizenics/shadcn-cookies\\n\\nN\\n\\nNiko\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n0 Nachrichten\\n\\n1 Mitglieder\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1404526270632693972)\\n\\n[\\n\\n![iOS app Feedbacks (Learning App)](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.discordapp.com%2Fattachments%2F1403911993823596564%2F1403911994209337436%2Fview_1.png%3Fex%3D695e5eae%26is%3D695d0d2e%26hm%3D10f213182253162807f13c0067b91337eef46302393c89613fc83a19171d50f7%26&w=3840&q=75)\\n\\n### iOS app Feedbacks (Learning App)\\n\\nArchiviert 2 months ago\\n\\npython\\n\\nHey everyone! My brother and I just launched a small Duolingo-style app for learning Python — gamified, short levels and fun animations. We’re just starting out and would really love honest feedback—what’s confusing, what’s fun, what’s broken. 👉 Try it: https://apps.apple.com/us/app/sideme-learn-coding/id6743945588 If you’ve got 2 minutes, drop thoughts here—screenshots/bugs super welcome!\\n\\nJ\\n\\nJason\\n\\nVerified\\n\\n8 Nachrichten\\n\\n6 Mitglieder\\n\\n5 months ago\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n](/de/community/showcase/1403911993823596564)\\n\\n[\\n\\n### Medium Post :Monitoring Spring Boot Code Quality with SonarQube on Docker and